        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG405-400-630 15-3/4\" Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClean contemporary ladder style door pull handle made of stainless steel by AHI Hardware. For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. Warm <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> finish requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired. This 15-3/4\" contemporary ladder style handle features a nice easy to grip 1-1/4\" round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors. Clean, contemporary, solid.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-D9000S-specifications.gif?v=1704354707\" width=\"400\" height=\"375\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG405-400 Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-610-630\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/36-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-914-630\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/48-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-1220-630\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG405-400-630 Contemporary Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 400 mm (15-3/4\")</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 150 mm (5-15/16\") C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Choice</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolt Mounting</b> - bolts through the door (1 pull)</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back mounting</b> - pulls bolt to each other through the door (requires two pulls)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle)</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Item Discontinued </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Item Discontinued use <a href=\"/products/16-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>16\" Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/14-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-355-630\"><b>14\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Item Discontinued </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
