                "title": "15-3/4 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull, AHI SIG405-400-630",
                "description": "AHI SIG405-400 door pulls. These 400 mm (15-3/4 inches) contemporary ladder style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1-1/4 inch round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors.  Clean, Contemporary, Solid. For use on residential and commercial doors. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired.",
